      "cat-harness:section": "4. Declare intent (write)",
      "prov:value": "- **Do not create a `Session: …` milestone or epic.** This step used to say\n  to, and in the `qou` folio 292 of 353 epics were the result (bean `8unf`):\n  a session is a LOG, and its log is the PR body (part c) plus a bean note on\n  each bean worked (`bun run cat beans:note <id>`, keyed by branch).",
